{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf5j5JKSsZHjLiWRQEDFf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests passed. The build succeeded with 17 tests (9 in ShipmentControllerTest which includes my 4 new tests).\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — Verified by `./mvnw test`, BUILD SUCCESS\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — All 4 original OrderControllerTest, 5 original ShipmentControllerTest, and 3 CustomerControllerTest tests pass\n3. ✅ **POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm confirms and persists** — Test `confirmCreatedShipmentMovesToConfirmed` verifies endpoint moves CREATED→CONFIRMED and test can fetch the updated shipment\n4. ✅ **Error responses consistent with API** — Uses same `ConflictException`, `ResourceNotFoundException`, and `ErrorCode` pattern as existing endpoints\n5. ✅ **Idempotent retry succeeds, cancelled refused, unknown refused** — Three tests cover these: `confirmConfirmedShipmentIsIdempotent()`, `rejectConfirmingCancelledShipmentWithConflictError()`, `rejectConfirmingNonExistentShipmentWithNotFoundError()`\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** — No pom.xml modified, no new dependencies added\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Only modified ShipmentController.kt, ApiError.kt, and ShipmentControllerTest.kt\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **`ApiError.kt:35`** — Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` error code to the enum. Required because the ticket specifies rejecting cancelled shipments with HTTP 409, which needs a distinct error code.\n\n2. **`ShipmentController.kt:57-79`** — Added `confirm()` method with `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")`. Required to implement the feature.\n   - Handles the 404 case (missing shipment)\n   - Handles the 200 case with state transition CREATED→CONFIRMED\n   - Handles the 200 case with idempotent retry (CONFIRMED→CONFIRMED)\n   - Handles the 409 case with CANCELLED r